{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707660/extras/f-steam2.png?t=1746792322\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Congratulations, unfortunate soul! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're now trapped in the Sahur mansion with the most <strong>cursed zombi versions</strong> of your <strong>favorite brainrot memes</strong>. They used to make you laugh. Now they'll make you scream.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">GAME FEATURES: </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Atmospheric horror with immersive sound design </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenging puzzles throughout the mansion </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stealth gameplay - hide from pursuing creatures </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover the story through collectible notes </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easter eggs and references for meme lovers</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707660/extras/05011-1-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1746792322\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">These monstrosities want what's left of your rotting brain, and they're not here to ask nicely. As you explore this nightmare fuel of a house you'll need to solve puzzles while avoiding becoming another creepypasta story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hidden throughout this dank mansion are notes from previous visitors (spoiler: they didn't make it). Read them if you dare, but more importantly, KEEP MOVING.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707660/extras/0501-2-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1746792322\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turns out those weird animals are even worse IRL. Who knew?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve the puzzles. Dodge the memes. Touch grass (if you ever get out).</p><p 